# Paths the PR reviewer does not read (SERV-87).
#
# One extended regex per line, matched against the repository-relative path
# of every changed file. `#` comments and blank lines are ignored. The
# shared workflow reads this from the BASE ref of the PR under review, so
# widening it in a PR does not exempt that PR — and this file is itself in
# `sensitive_paths`, so a PR that widens it escalates.

# release-please owns this and rewrites it wholesale on every release. It is
# also `.md`, so the docs-only rule already skips a release PR that touches
# nothing else; this covers the case where it rides along with code.
^CHANGELOG\.md$
